  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>빤<ruby>쳰<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>훼<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>뤼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> 주<ruby>뾰<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>비<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>애<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kkUWlcjmOew?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>下晡<rt>에버ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>一个人<rt>짇에랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>踮<rt>댬ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>厝內<rt>추ˋ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    e-pôr, jit-e-láng tiàm-chù-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>西北雨<rt>새ˉ박ˆ허ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>沃澹<rt>악ˆ담-</rt></ruby><ruby>窗外<rt>탕ˉ꽈ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>衫<rt>살ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sāi-pâk-hōr, âk-tam-thāng-goā’e sâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>外口<rt>꽈ᄏᅷˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>猶未<rt>얗ˆ쀄-</rt></ruby><ruby>轉<rt>등ˋ</rt></ruby>’래\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goa-khàu’e láng yâh-bue-tǹg’lai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>慐慐<rt>껑껑ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>等<rt>단ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>慐慐<rt>껑껑-</rt></ruby><ruby>攑<rt>꺟-</rt></ruby><ruby>一支<rt>짇기ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>雨傘<rt>허솰</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gong-gōng lêh-tàn, gong-gong-giah-jit-kī-hor-soa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>幾若擺<rt>귀ˆ나배ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>睏<rt>쿤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>去<rt>킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-lì, kûi-na-pài khùn-boe-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>全世界<rt>좐세ˋ개</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>揣<rt>췌-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>形影<rt>혱얄ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    joan-sè-kai, chue-boe-tioh-lì’e hieng-yà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>凡勢<rt>환세</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby>가<ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>放捒<rt>방ˋ삭</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hoan-se, e-tàng-ka-lì pàng-sak\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>氣身惱命<rt>키ˋ신ˉ로ˆ먀ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>要<rt>ᄋᆤ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>緊<rt>긴ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khì-sīn-lô-miā, goà nà e-lông-bo-yau bo-kìn\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>踮<rt>댬ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>쟈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby>規<rt>귀ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>暝<rt>메ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>電火<rt>뎬훼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>閃爍<rt>샴ˆ싷</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tiàm-jiâ kūi-mé, khoà̰-tien-huè siâm-sih\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>踮<rt>댬ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>쟈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>等待<rt>단ˆ태ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>拍<rt>팧ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀ˊ</rt></ruby>’킈에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà tiàm-jiâ tân-thāi, phâh-bó’khi-e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>聽<rt>턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>厝內<rt>추ˋ래ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>聲<rt>샬ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>聲聲<rt>샬ˉ샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>吼<rt>ᄒᅷˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thiā̰-chù-lāi’e siâ̰, siā̰-siâ̰ ti-lêh-hàu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’레 <ruby>踅<rt>셓ˆ</rt></ruby>’킈, <ruby>思念<rt>수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>火燒<rt>훼ˆ쇼ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>房間<rt>방곙ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà sêh’le sêh’khi, sū-liām huê-siō-pang-kiêng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>開<rt>퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>轉<rt>등ˋ</rt></ruby>’<ruby>래<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    boe-khûi’e huê, bo-bêh-tǹg’lài-e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>美麗<rt>삐ˆ레ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> 앟 <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>當時<rt>덩ˉ시ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>攑<rt>꺟-</rt></ruby><ruby>懸<rt>괠-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>旗仔<rt>기아ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bî-lē’e lì, ah siṵ-tioh-lì hît-tōng-sí, giah-koa̰i-lì’e ki-à\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>路邊<rt>러빌ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>話<rt>웨ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>滿<rt>뫄ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>街路<rt>괴ˉ러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>雨<rt>허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>紛飛<rt>훈ˉ휘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lor-pḭ̂’e wē, moâ-koē-lōr hōr hūn-hûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>時代<rt>시대</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>變化<rt>볜ˋ화</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>孤單<rt>거ˉ돨ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>一个人<rt>짇에랑ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>天<rt>틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>捌<rt>빧</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-tai’e pièn-hoa, kōr-toâ̰’e goâ-jit-e-láng, mng-thḭ̂ ya-m-bat\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>手內<rt>츄ˆ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiû-lāi siâ̰-mîh lông-bó\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>賰<rt>춘ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jî-chūn-goâ-bêh-hor-lì’e ai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>血<rt>휗</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>肉<rt>빻</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-hueh u-bah’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>煞<rt>쇃ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>下落不明<rt>헤롷붇ˆ뼹ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    soâh-he-loh-pût-biéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    가<ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>記持<rt>기ˋ디ˊ</rt></ruby>’앟, <ruby>囥<rt>킁ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ka-lì’e kì-tí’ah, khǹg-ti-goà’e sīm-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>騎<rt>캬-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>白馬<rt>벻뻬ˋ</rt></ruby>’앟, <ruby>行<rt>걀-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khia-lì’e peh-bè’ah, kia̰-lî-bêh-kiá̰’e lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>風<rt>헝ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>吹<rt>췌ˆ</rt></ruby>’래, <ruby>花<rt>훼ˆ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>落塗<rt>롷터ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>點<rt>댬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一欉<rt>짇장-</rt></ruby><ruby>香<rt>휼ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>祈求<rt>기규ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hông chuê’lai, huê loh-thór, tiâm-jit-jang-hiṵ̂ ki-kiú\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>南無<rt>나머-</rt></ruby><ruby>觀世音<rt>관ˉ세ˋ임ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>菩薩<rt>퍼삳</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-mor-koān-sè-īm-phor-sat\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>若準<rt>나준ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>出<rt>춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>悲劇<rt>비ˉ격ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-jûn-kông-lì, sǹg-tioh-jît-chût-pī-kiôrk\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>看顧<rt>콸ˋ거</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>煞<rt>쇃</rt></ruby>’롷래 이<ruby>頭前<rt>ᄐᅷ졩-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>逝<rt>좌-</rt></ruby><ruby>歹行<rt>팰ˆ걀ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kâm-e-khoà̰-kor, soah’loh-lai i-thau-jieng-hît-joa-phâ̰i-kiá̰’e lōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>夢中<rt>빵뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>沓沓仔<rt>ᄃᅷᇂᄃᅷᇂ아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bang-tiông’e goà, khoà̰-lì tauh-tauh-â-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>牽<rt>칸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>亡魂<rt>뻥훈ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>做伙<rt>조ˋ훼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>轉<rt>등ˋ</rt></ruby>’킈 <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>个<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>所在<rt>서ˆ재ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khān-lì’e bong-hún, u-jit-kâng làn jò-huè tǹg’khi hît-e-sôr-jāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>蔫<rt>롄ˆ</rt></ruby>’킈에 <ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby> (<ruby>規<rt>귀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시ˉ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà liên’khi-e ai (kūi-lōr lông-sī)\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>恬<rt>댬ˉ</rt></ruby>’킈에 <ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâh-lì tiām’khi-e sîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>제<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>烏暗<rt>어ˉ암ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>時代<rt>시대</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ti-jê-ōr-àm-si-tai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>緣<rt>옌ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>分<rt>훈ˉ</rt></ruby> (<ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>’춛)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-u-yén bo-hūn (siṵ-bêh-kòng’chut)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>了<rt>ᄅᆤˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>批<rt>풰ˆ</rt></ruby> (<ruby>奈何<rt>내호ˊ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siâ-boe-liàu’e phuê (nai-hó)\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>煞<rt>쇃</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>話<rt>웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâh-kông-boe-soah’e wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>인<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>開<rt>퀴ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>完<rt>완ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>銃<rt>촁</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    īn khūi-boe-oán’e chieng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人去樓空<rt>랑킈ˋᄅᅷ캉ˆ</rt></ruby> (<ruby>火烌猶在<rt>훼ˆ후ˉ유ˉ재ˉ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-lang-khì-lau-khâng (huê-hū-yū-jāi)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>雨<rt>허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>微微<rt>삐삐-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>落<rt>롷ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hōr bi-bi-â-lôh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>天<rt>틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>微微<rt>삐삐-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>光<rt>긍ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thḭ̂ bi-bi-â-kn̂g\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>微微<rt>삐삐-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>笑<rt>쵸</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-lì bi-bi-â-chio\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>後世人<rt>ᄋᅷ시ˋ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>再會<rt>재ˋ훼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    au-sì-láng jài-huē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n"
}
